Z||000005||2xsess||01-01-2001||06:05 PM||||Here's MrMikes reply :<P><B>Jeff,<BR>   Yes, I make manual shift boots in both standard and short shifter<BR>heights.  They can be in light gray, dark gray, and charcoal leather.<BR>It is the boot only, you must glue it to the original frame.  Price is<BR>$20 + shipping </B><P>Looks like I'll be getting one soon  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG"> ||||reg||14
